{"unit_id":"Sutera-Diffusus__dsh-sandbox-tester#card-zh","repo":"Sutera-Diffusus/dsh-sandbox-tester","commit":"8fd746dc1fd0946c5491b0e2967ab0d22e4fba4e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sandbox 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的隔离测试沙盒插件。它在 DSH 中注册沙盒生命周期、启动检查和合回门禁工具，并提供设置页管理界面。用户可以创建独立程序副本、数据目录和端口的测试实例，向实例注入文件补丁，运行实例并检查 HTTP 健康状态，也可停止、销毁或清理沙盒；合回工具先校验目标并默认只做 dry run。适合需要验证 DSH 插件或补丁、又希望把测试实例与常规实例分开的开发者。代码默认针对 Windows DSH 安装目录，使用本机 Node.js 和进程管理；没有代码声明的 API key 或外部服务依赖。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:268-309","lib/tools-lifecycle.js:287-375","lib/tools-runhealth.js:257-314","client/client.js:181-239"]}
{"unit_id":"Sutera-Diffusus__dsh-sandbox-tester#card-en","repo":"Sutera-Diffusus/dsh-sandbox-tester","commit":"8fd746dc1fd0946c5491b0e2967ab0d22e4fba4e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sandbox is a DSH web plugin for isolated development tests. Its tools create separate DSH copies, inject patches, start instances and check health. Users can stop or prune sandboxes; merge checks default to a dry run. It targets Windows and declares no API key or external service requirement.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:268-309","lib/tools-lifecycle.js:287-375","lib/tools-runhealth.js:257-314","client/client.js:181-239"]}
